Id: dbs019w
Severity: WARN
Category: services
Check: check_databases
Fix: Bind Redis to localhost (bind 127.0.0.1 ::1) where the network need not reach it.
References: redis-server(1)
Controls: CIS 4.4; NIST SC-7; ISO 8.20; CE Firewalls

Redis listens past localhost with only its password between
the network and the keys. One guessed or leaked secret opens
every key to the network; bind it to localhost where the
network need not reach it.
